          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "Does the lunar calendar affect the prediction?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "Yes, the lunar calendar is central to the prediction. The chart maps the mother's lunar age against the lunar month of conception, not the Gregorian calendar month. Each lunar month begins on a new moon and lasts about 29.5 days. Our calculator handles the date conversion automatically so you can enter your regular Gregorian dates."
