              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "The predictor is completely safe to use. It is a digital tool that makes no medical claims and performs no physical measurements. It simply applies a traditional chart to provide an entertaining guess. Always consult your healthcare provider for medical advice about pregnancy and gender determination."
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "Is this calculator just for fun?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "Yes, this calculator is intended for entertainment and educational purposes only. It is based on a traditional cultural chart and should not be used to make medical decisions. Enjoy exploring the tradition, but rely on your doctor and medical tests for accurate gender information."
